question:
What is the output order?

```js
console.log(1);
setTimeout(() => console.log(2));
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log(3));
console.log(4);
```

What is the output?

```js
const obj = {
  val: 42,
  regular() { return this.val; },
  arrow: () => this.val,
};
console.log(obj.regular(), obj.arrow());
```

What is the output?

```js
const a = { x: 1, nested: { y: 2 } };
const b = { ...a };
b.nested.y = 99;
console.log(a.nested.y);
```

What does this currying pattern let you do?

```js
const add = a => b => a + b;
const add5 = add(5);
console.log(add5(3), add5(10));
```
